        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_aa3927ec26574fd19f95b2b0126e3adb",
      "statement": "The production model configuration is a 16-layer decoder with `d_model=1024`, 8 query heads, 4 key/value heads, `head_dim=128`, `d_ff=4096`, vocabulary size 128000, sequence length 2048, RoPE theta 500000.0, QK-Norm enabled, and RMSNorm epsilon 1e-5.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://config.py#L40-L43",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:a29ed26130149c97366cb882232daf13e580316c219e8cd9547c967861417faf:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://config.py#L7-L16",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:ce153d186ae7e188573bd1132d64941f9204826f2476d12982b909743bf3426c:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_be4013ac75644eafb3a59a201548d53f",
      "statement": "The trainer gates Triton kernel implementations with the exact environment switch `ENABLE_TRITON_KERNELS=1`; if any of `rmsnorm_impl`, `swiglu_impl`, or `cross_entropy_impl` requests Triton without that switch, it force-restores all three implementations to PyTorch.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://train.py#L299-L313",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:0e7605d1579a7df3e64a66e03c5e8b8ef9b9b140ba40b42131b249b21c1f661b:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_1f6756f913a34197bc6a67e0b8b605f1",
      "statement": "On CUDA, `setup_gpu_optimizations` applies TF32, high float32 matmul precision, the configured cuDNN benchmark setting, nondeterministic cuDNN mode, and `cuda_alloc_conf` through `PYTORCH_CUDA_ALLOC_CONF`; the trainer invokes it only for a CUDA run.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://train.py#L270-L277",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:0c54ef5d3bc2ddd884665b3cf6eab3a8a2d3abc16c98e62fa9bd3a97c63db6e0:"
