        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_087ea80ce7404d17975254658ba5cbdf",
      "statement": "The optimizer uses AdamW with separate decay and no-decay parameter groups, and the production scheduler is a linear warmup followed by cosine annealing to `min_lr`; gradient accumulation delays clipping, optimizer, EMA, zeroing, and scheduler updates until the configured accumulation boundary.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://train.py#L378-L407",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:8165f4dc3b0f199f7c59d1838bb3eb3c4a2dc1717ee6878e628ce73b21cbb0b0:"
        },
        {
