        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://train.py#L506-L515",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:af6e40e2d77c98622e2e318faf42540e50efb4b089d6e7e2eb104993605c6c09:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_4f2452cd6dd748e8a23261af320925e3",
      "statement": "With the production defaults, one optimizer step accounts for `batch_size * seq_len * gradient_accumulation` tokens, or 196,608 tokens, and the 42,000-step plan accounts for 8,257,536,000 tokens; when the loader is exhausted, the trainer advances the sampler epoch and restarts iteration instead of terminating.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://config.py#L18-L25",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:7c4e93c03e5e470707bc09c09be1e0893eb2a2f8468c0e451532d7f9ce212087:"
