    {
      "id": "claim_fae432c6b0c142718854d1e6cdee6580",
      "statement": "The runtime data cache defaults to `data_cache/tokens.bin`; `build_training_data` opens it as a read-only `uint32` memory map, uses non-overlapping `seq_len+1` windows for shifted input/target pairs, and creates a final `val_split` holdout with training `drop_last=True` and ordered validation.",
