    {
      "id": "claim_188d16d4ba724e2eb3e1c7406f614822",
      "statement": "A missing runtime cache is a visible but non-fatal training fallback: `train_model` catches `FileNotFoundError`, warns that real data is absent, and builds synthetic random-token loaders; tokenizer loading can separately fall back to a byte stub while retaining the real cached training ids.",
