      "id": "claim_d4c101e795aa457f889e24176c311602",
      "statement": "Validation and generation use EMA when enabled, while the best-model artifact saves the live model state; validation is capped by `val_max_batches`, generation uses five fixed prompts with configured temperature/top-k plus hard-coded `top_p=0.9`, and periodic side effects run in logging, validation, generation, checkpoint order when intervals coincide.",
