    {
      "id": "claim_ca2d9074e69b4bf5865c5b6002dd23f1",
      "statement": "Periodic checkpoints are named `<model_filename>_step_<step>.pt`, contain model, optimizer, scheduler, step, token-count, best-loss, configuration, RNG, and optional EMA state, and are numerically retained according to `keep_last_n_checkpoints`; final persistence writes separate full-state and weights-only files, while shutdown joins the last asynchronous save thread first.",
